{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato","soma"],"title":"Tissā","html":"<article id='thig1.4'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Therīgāthā 1.4 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Nuns 1.4 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Bhikkhunīs </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Chapter of the Ones </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Tissātherīgāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Tissā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Tissā </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Tisse sikkhassu sikkhāya, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Tissā, train in the trainings—</span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>“Tissā, train yourself with discipline; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>mā taṁ yogā upaccaguṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>don’t let your yokes overcome you. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>do not let bonds tie you down. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sabbayogavisaṁyuttā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Unyoked from all yokes, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>All bonds unbound, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>cara loke anāsavā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>live in the world free of defilements. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>walk in the world free from influences.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Tissā therī …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>The Elder Tissā </span></p></article>"}
